          "",
          "   saya   I            apa    what",
          "   kamu   you          bukan  not (a noun)",
          "   ini    this         belum  not yet",
          "   itu    that         juga   too, also",
          "   di     at, in       saja   just, only",
          "   ke     to           dan    and",
          "   dari   from         yang   who, which",
          "",
          "Each of them comes back in its own",
          "lesson: people, questions, saying no,",
          "joining words, time, and places."
        ]
