          "",
          "   siapa      who",
          "   apa        what",
          "   mana       which, and where with di/ke",
          "   berapa     how many, how much",
          "   kapan      when",
          "   bagaimana  how",
          "   mengapa    why (kenapa in speech)",
          "",
          "   Siapa orang itu?",
          "   = Who is that person?",
          "",
          "   Dari mana asal Anda?",
          "   = Where are you from?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 3,
        "content": [
          "mana takes the same three little words",
          "that places take:",
          "",
          "   di mana   where (at)",
          "   ke mana   where to",
          "   dari mana where from",
          "",
          "For a yes-or-no question, say the",
          "statement and lift your voice at the end.",
          "",
          "   Ada kabar dari dia?                Press 1",
          "   = Any news from him?",
          "",
          "In writing, and to be formal, add -kah to",
          "the word in question, or open with",
          "apakah:",
          "   Apakah ini rumah Anda?",
          "   = Is this your house?"
