          "goes in front of the verb and says it.",
          "",
          "   sudah   already, done",
          "   sedang  in the middle of it",
          "   akan    going to, will",
          "   masih   still",
          "   belum   not yet",
          "   pernah  has ever, once did",
          "",
          "   Kakak saya sudah menikah.          Press 1",
          "   = My older sister is already married.",
          "",
          "   Kami akan pergi ke kota besok.     Press 2",
          "   = We are going into town tomorrow."
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Kakak saya sudah menikah.",
          "2": "Kami akan pergi ke kota besok."
        }
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 3,
        "content": [
